WEBVTT

00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:08.092
(HEAVY BREATHING)

00:00:11.852 --> 00:00:15.372
VOICE BOX: Yee-haw!
Giddyap, pardner!

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:17.812
We got to get this wagon train
a-movin'!

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:18.892
(SNARLING)

00:00:18.932 --> 00:00:20.292
(GROWLING)

00:00:21.052 --> 00:00:23.852
-Split up!
-(SCUD GROWLING)

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:28.732
(SNIFFING)

00:00:28.812 --> 00:00:30.892
(SNARLING) Hmm?

00:00:32.412 --> 00:00:34.332
(GROWLING)

00:00:35.732 --> 00:00:37.012
(SNORING)

00:00:40.292 --> 00:00:43.092
(SNARLS, PANTING)

00:00:44.572 --> 00:00:47.372
MAN: Calling Buzz Lightyear.
Come in, Buzz Lightyear.

00:00:47.412 --> 00:00:49.492
-This is Star Command.
-Star Command!

00:00:49.572 --> 00:00:51.652
-Buzz Lightyear, do you read me?
-BOY: Buzz Lightyear responding.

00:00:51.772 --> 00:00:52.812
Read you loud and clear.

00:00:52.892 --> 00:00:55.412
MAN: Buzz Lightyear,
planet Earth needs your help.

00:00:55.492 --> 00:00:57.652
BOY: On the way!
CHORUS: Buzz Lightyear!

00:00:57.732 --> 00:00:59.772
ANNOUNCER: The world's
greatest superhero!

00:00:59.812 --> 00:01:02.252
Now the world's greatest toy!

00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:05.292
Buzz has it all!
Locking wrist communicator!

00:01:05.412 --> 00:01:07.812
-BOY: Calling Buzz Lightyear!
-Karate chop action!

00:01:07.892 --> 00:01:09.932
-BOY: Wow!
-Pulsating laser light!

00:01:10.012 --> 00:01:13.412
-BOY: Total annihilation!
-Multi-phrase voice simulator!

00:01:13.452 --> 00:01:15.612
VOICE BOX: There's a secret mission
in uncharted space.

00:01:15.692 --> 00:01:17.092
VOICE BOX: There's a secret mission
in uncharted space.

00:01:18.452 --> 00:01:20.812
And best of all,
high pressure space wings!

00:01:20.892 --> 00:01:24.612
-To infinity and beyond!
-ANNOUNCER 2: Not a flying toy.

00:01:24.692 --> 00:01:26.412
ANNOUNCER 1: Get your
Buzz Lightyear action figure

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:29.692
-and save a galaxy near you!
-CHORUS: Buzz Lightyear!

00:01:29.812 --> 00:01:32.292
Available at all Al's Toy Barn outlets
in the tri-county area.

00:01:34.852 --> 00:01:35.852
SPORTSCASTER:
And welcome back to the

00:01:35.932 --> 00:01:38.292
Point Richmond
Bowling Championship.

00:01:38.332 --> 00:01:40.692
(SPORTSCASTER CONTINUES)

00:01:40.772 --> 00:01:45.132
♪ Out among the stars I sail

00:01:45.172 --> 00:01:47.892
♪ Way beyond the moon

00:01:49.532 --> 00:01:53.972
♪ In my silver ship I sailed

00:01:54.012 --> 00:01:58.172
♪ To a dream
that ended too soon

00:01:58.212 --> 00:02:01.092
♪ Now I know exactly

00:02:01.172 --> 00:02:03.132
♪ Who I am and what I'm here for

00:02:03.172 --> 00:02:06.092
-(CHIRPING)
-WOODY'S VOICE: You are a toy!

00:02:06.172 --> 00:02:08.172
You can't fly!

00:02:10.012 --> 00:02:14.492
♪ And I will go sailing

00:02:15.732 --> 00:02:18.172
♪ No more

00:02:22.892 --> 00:02:26.852
♪ But no, it can't be true

00:02:26.892 --> 00:02:30.052
♪ I could fly if I wanted to

00:02:30.132 --> 00:02:32.892
♪ Like a bird in the sky

00:02:32.972 --> 00:02:35.852
♪ If I believed I could fly

00:02:35.892 --> 00:02:38.532
♪ Why, I'd fly

00:02:38.612 --> 00:02:41.412
To infinity and beyond!

00:02:57.172 --> 00:03:00.972
♪ Clearly, I

00:03:01.052 --> 00:03:05.732
♪ Will go sailing

00:03:05.812 --> 00:03:08.372
♪ No more ♪

00:03:21.652 --> 00:03:24.852
Mom! Mom, have you seen
my Sally doll?

00:03:24.892 --> 00:03:27.892
-(CLICK)
-MOM: What, dear? What was that?

00:03:28.492 --> 00:03:30.612
Never mind!

00:03:32.532 --> 00:03:34.572
(RATTLING)

00:03:35.332 --> 00:03:37.852
Oof! Oof! (GROANS)

00:03:37.932 --> 00:03:40.772
Buzz, the coast is clear.
Buzz, where are you?

00:03:40.812 --> 00:03:44.292
BUZZ'S VOICE BOX: There's a secret
mission in uncharted space. Let's go.

00:03:44.372 --> 00:03:47.772
HANNAH: Really?
That is so interesting.

00:03:49.012 --> 00:03:51.332
Would you like some tea,
Mrs. Nesbitt?

00:03:51.452 --> 00:03:52.612
(GASPS) Buzz!

00:03:52.652 --> 00:03:56.092
It's so nice you could join us
on such late notice.

00:03:56.132 --> 00:03:59.732
-Oh, no!
-What a lovely hat, Mrs. Nesbitt.

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:01.932
It goes quite well with your head.

00:04:02.052 --> 00:04:03.492
(CLEARS THROAT,
IMITATING MOTHER) Hannah!

00:04:04.292 --> 00:04:05.292
Oh, Hannah!

00:04:05.452 --> 00:04:08.212
Mom? Please excuse me, ladies.

00:04:08.292 --> 00:04:10.092
I'll be right back.

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:16.892
What is it, Mom?
Mom, where are you?

00:04:16.972 --> 00:04:19.452
Buzz. Hey.
Buzz, are you okay?

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:22.772
Gone!
(SNIFFLES) It's all gone.

00:04:22.812 --> 00:04:25.692
All of it's gone.
Bye-bye. Whoo-whoo. See ya.

00:04:25.772 --> 00:04:26.812
What happened to you?

00:04:26.892 --> 00:04:29.572
One minute you're defending
the whole galaxy.

00:04:29.652 --> 00:04:33.652
And suddenly you find yourself
suckin' down Darjeeling with

00:04:33.692 --> 00:04:36.852
Marie Antoinette
and her little sister.

00:04:36.932 --> 00:04:38.652
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:38.732 --> 00:04:41.052
I think you've had
enough tea for today.

00:04:41.172 --> 00:04:42.892
Let's get you outta here, Buzz.

00:04:42.972 --> 00:04:45.972
Don't you get it?
You see the hat?

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:50.932
-I am Mrs. Nesbitt! Ha-ha-ha-ha!
-Snap out of it, Buzz!

00:04:51.012 --> 00:04:53.332
(HYSTERICAL CHUCKLING,
SQUEAKS)

00:04:54.852 --> 00:04:57.132
I-I-I-I'm sorry. I...
You're right.

00:04:57.172 --> 00:05:00.052
I am just a little depressed.
That's all.

00:05:00.132 --> 00:05:02.172
I can get through this.

00:05:02.252 --> 00:05:04.012
-Oh, I'm a sham!
-Shh!

00:05:04.092 --> 00:05:05.372
-Look at me.
-Quiet, Buzz.

00:05:05.452 --> 00:05:08.332
I can't even fly out of a window.

00:05:08.412 --> 00:05:11.692
The hat looked good?
Tell me the hat looked good.

00:05:11.772 --> 00:05:14.612
-The apron is a bit much.
-"Out the window"!

00:05:14.692 --> 00:05:15.972
Buzz, you're a genius!

00:05:16.012 --> 00:05:18.372
-(CRYING)
-Come on, come on. This way.

00:05:18.452 --> 00:05:21.652
Years of academy, training, wasted!

00:05:22.212 --> 00:05:24.052
Ha, ha. B-3.

00:05:24.132 --> 00:05:26.292
-Miss! G-6.
-Oh!

00:05:26.372 --> 00:05:28.572
-You sunk it. Are you peeking?
-Heh, heh!

00:05:28.652 --> 00:05:31.972
Oh, quit your whinin' and pay up.
No, no, not the ear.

00:05:32.052 --> 00:05:34.452
-Give me the nose. Come on.
-How about three out of five?

00:05:35.892 --> 00:05:38.892
(STRAINING) Hey, guys! Guys! Hey!

00:05:39.212 --> 00:05:42.572
-Son of a building block. It's Woody.
-He's in the psycho's bedroom.

00:05:42.692 --> 00:05:45.092
-Ha, ha! Hi!
-Everyone! It's Woody!

00:05:45.172 --> 00:05:46.212
-Woody?
-You're kidding!

00:05:46.292 --> 00:05:49.372
-Woody?
-Ha! We're gonna get outta here, Buzz.

00:05:49.892 --> 00:05:50.892
Buzz?

00:05:50.972 --> 00:05:53.572
(IMITATING AIRPLANE)

00:05:53.612 --> 00:05:55.892
(SPUTTERING, CRASHING)

00:05:55.972 --> 00:05:57.612
-Hey, look!
-Woody!

00:05:57.692 --> 00:05:59.812
Oh, boy, am I glad
to see you guys.

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:02.572
-I knew you'd come back, Woody.
-What are you doin' over there?

00:06:02.652 --> 00:06:05.092
It's a long story, Bo.
I'll explain later.

00:06:05.172 --> 00:06:07.172
Here! Catch this!

00:06:07.252 --> 00:06:08.252
BO: Ha!

00:06:08.332 --> 00:06:10.772
-Whoa! I've got it, Woody.
-He got it, Woody.

00:06:10.852 --> 00:06:13.732
Good goin', Slink. Now just,
just tie it on to somethin'.

00:06:13.812 --> 00:06:16.292
Wait, wait, wait, wait. I got
a better idea. How 'bout we don't?

00:06:16.372 --> 00:06:17.732
-Hey!
-Potato Head.

00:06:17.772 --> 00:06:19.812
Did you all take stupid pills
this morning?

00:06:19.892 --> 00:06:21.892
Have you forgotten
what he did to Buzz?

00:06:21.932 --> 00:06:23.412
And now you wanna let him
back over here?

00:06:23.492 --> 00:06:27.932
No! No, no, no, no, no! You got it...
You got it all wrong, Potato Head.

00:06:28.012 --> 00:06:30.372
Buzz is fine. Buzz is right here.
He's with me!

00:06:30.412 --> 00:06:33.772
-You are a liar!
-No, I'm not. Buzz, come over here.

00:06:33.852 --> 00:06:37.612
Tell the nice toys that you're...
that you're not dead.

00:06:37.772 --> 00:06:41.532
(GASPS, SPUTTERS) Just a sec!

00:06:41.612 --> 00:06:44.732
Buzz, will you get up here
and give me a hand?

00:06:45.572 --> 00:06:48.292
(CHUCKLING) That's very funny, Buzz.

00:06:48.332 --> 00:06:51.452
-This is serious!
-REX: Hey, Woody! Where'd ya go?

00:06:51.492 --> 00:06:53.572
POTATO HEAD: He's lying.
Buzz ain't there.

